@j-b-z that's not how lazer works though. You can now change the curve type per section. The type in the video is linear. This is new functionality which actually allows a lot more flexibility with sliders that was previously either difficult or impossible.

The best path forward here may be to not set the curve type to linear in this case, and leave it as a "linear" bezier curve.

Red points don't indicate linear. They indicate a new section.
